              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Beneficial National Bank, mr. Waxman (representing the petitioner) stated that the complaint alleges excessive interest and that the National Bank Act provides the exclusive standards for interest rates."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fc47e35151e8513a13574becb9d9e4fe5cb7a4e74aeb9f25996fdb7be110511a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fc47e35151e8-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Mr. Roberts explained that the removal statute gives a defendant the right to remove to federal court any claim that arises under the laws of the United States."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Clark",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fc47e35151e8513a13574becb9d9e4fe5cb7a4e74aeb9f25996fdb7be110511a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fc47e35151e8-0001-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Mr. Clark argued that Congress has not provided an exclusive Federal cause of action to govern an Alabama usury claim."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fc47e35151e8513a13574becb9d9e4fe5cb7a4e74aeb9f25996fdb7be110511a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fc47e35151e8-0001-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court observed that the complaint states a claim under Federal law."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice (unspecified)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fc47e35151e8513a13574becb9d9e4fe5cb7a4e74aeb9f25996fdb7be110511a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fc47e35151e8-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice (unspecified), according to Justice (unspecified), another Justice asked whether, if the Federal cause of action is not exclusive, the case would remain in State court."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fc47e35151e8513a13574becb9d9e4fe5cb7a4e74aeb9f25996fdb7be110511a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fc47e35151e8-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 48,
              "start": 48
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners, petitioners responded that the complaint pleads all elements of a Federal cause of action, but it also satisfies a State cause; if the Federal cause is not exclusive except in rare instances, the case is not removable."
      }
    ],
